    "body": "## Summary\n\nDeterministic handoff snapshot (\u03a0) capturing the continuation of backend lint remediation, kanban maintenance, and ingestion build artifacts.\n\n## Backend async/await lint remediation\n\nSystematic conversion of raw Promise chains (`.then`/`.catch`) to `^:async`/`await` across 94 CLJS files:\n\n- **Bluesky** (`domain/bluesky/bluesky.cljs`): auth, session, search, profile, publish, social, chat helpers\n- **Discord** (`domain/discord/gateway.cljs`, `domain/discord/tools.cljs`): gateway and tool flows\n- **Auth session** (`infra/auth/session.cljs`): OAuth, cookies, API keys, session creation\n- **Policy DB** (`infra/db/policy.cljs`): roles, orgs, users, data lakes\n- **App routes** (`infra/routes/app.cljs`): proxy, data, health, session, admin, chat\n- **Memory routes** (`infra/routes/memory.cljs`): cache, session, search\n- **Translation & Voice** (`infra/routes/translation.cljs`, `infra/routes/voice.cljs`)\n- **Redis client**, **stores**, **sources**, **law guards/url**, **temp memory**, **SVG render**\n- **Agent session/tool-catalog/turn**\n\n**Warnings reduced**: ~1461 \u2192 ~823 (continuous improvement). **0 errors** maintained throughout.\n\n## Kanban\n\n- Status updates and triage notes on existing epics/tasks/workbench cards\n- 70+ new kanban task files for upcoming workstreams (knowledge-lake, chat UI, CMS, multi-tenant, PII, etc.)\n\n## Ingestion\n\n- Rebuilt `ingestion/target/kms-ingestion.jar`\n\n## Verification\n\n- `pnpm -C backend typecheck`: 307 files, 0 warnings\n- `pnpm -C backend exec shadow-cljs compile test`: 452 tests, 1326 assertions, 0 failures/errors\n- Secret heuristic scan: passed\n\n## Tag\n\n`pi/fork-tax/20260601T002600Z/knoxx-backend-async-lint-continuation`",
